Agent Driven EdPM — Attribution / 출처

This project started from the document-chaining (deliverable dependency order) and
gate-check (prerequisite verification before each deliverable) approach of
AP-Framework, taught in the "Agent PM" course, and extends it for EdTech.
It is an independent personal project, not an official distribution of AP-Framework
or the course. It does not include the course's templates, prompts, or lecture
materials. The MIT License (see LICENSE) applies only to the contents of this repository.

